OL,3,AInmates deny attempt to murder Sara
OL,4,ASharif's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo prisoners have pleaded not guilty
OL,7,Fto the attempted murder of Urfan
OL,8,FSharif, who is serving a life sentence
OL,9,Ffor killing his 10-year-old daughter,
OL,10,FSara Sharif.
OL,12,FSteven Sansom, 47, and Adam Watson, 39,
OL,13,Fwere charged last month following an
OL,14,Fattack in Belmarsh Prison on 1 January
OL,15,F2025, which reportedly left Sharif with
OL,16,Fcuts to his face.
OL,18,FSharif and Sara's stepmother, Beinash
OL,19,FBatool, were sentenced to life
OL,20,Fimprisonment for murdering Sara at
OL,21,Ftheir home in Woking, Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
